WEBVTT

00:00:00.035 --> 00:00:04.058
Drag a table header to give the relationship more space.

00:00:04.058 --> 00:00:05.407
Select New note in the bottom-left toolbar.

00:00:05.407 --> 00:00:09.882
Write a design reminder in the new note.

00:00:09.882 --> 00:00:12.110
Use Fit view to bring every object into view.
